### Categories API Tests


### Base URL

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1


### Create a new category

# @name createCategory

POST {{host}}/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{readerAuth}}

{
  "description": "Articles about technology, programming, and software development",
  "name": "Technlgy"
}


### Create another category

# @name createCategory2

POST {{host}}/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

{
  "description": "Everything related to web development",
  "name": "Web Development",
  "slug": "web-development"
}


### Update a category

# @name updateCategory

PUT {{host}}/categories/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

{
  "description": "Articles about technology, programming, software development, and innovation",
  "name": "Technology & Innovation"
}


### Get a single category by ID

# @name getCategory

GET {{host}}/categories/12 HTTP/1.1


### Get all categories

# @name getAllCategories

GET {{host}}/categories?page=0&size=10 HTTP/1.1


### Get category by slug

# @name getCategoryBySlug

GET {{host}}/categories/slug/web-development HTTP/1.1


### Delete a category

# @name deleteCategory

DELETE {{host}}/categories/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### Test create category with duplicate slug (validation)

# @name createDuplicateCategory

POST {{host}}/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

{
  "description": "Duplicate slug test",
  "name": "Another Technology",
  "slug": "technology"
}


### Test create category with missing required fields

# @name createInvalidCategory

POST {{host}}/categories HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

{
  "description": "Missing name and slug"
}


### Test update non-existent category

# @name updateInvalidCategory

PUT {{host}}/categories/99999 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

{
  "name": "This should fail"
}


### Get category with post count

# @name getCategoryWithPostCount

GET {{host}}/categories/1/with-post-count HTTP/1.1


### Get popular categories (sorted by post count)

# @name getPopularCategories

GET {{host}}/categories/popular?limit=5 HTTP/1.1
